flowchart LR
    subgraph H[Harness agent]
        A[Agent loop<br/>intent classification → tool selection<br/>→ parallel execution → sub-agent delegation]
        T[30+ MCP tools<br/>Kubernetes control · code editing · observability]
        A --- T
    end

    subgraph M[Management plane — authoring & deployment]
        GW[Gateway<br/>auth & permission boundary]
        SC[Scenario management<br/>register · validate · deploy · version]
        CAT[Resource catalog<br/>models · services · indexes · datasources]
        GW --> SC
        GW --> CAT
    end

    subgraph R[Runtime plane — execution & streaming]
        ORCH[Conversation orchestrator]
        RUN[Execution runtime<br/>loads deployed scenarios · glass-box streaming]
        ORCH --> RUN
    end

    A -->|every management action goes through the gateway| GW
    A -->|smoke tests only| ORCH
    SC -->|deploy · version tag| RUN
    HITL[Human approval<br/>only irreversible production deploys] -. gate .-> SC

